      "proposition": {
        "predicate": "summary",
        "object": "<p>Party leader in England and Wales seen as favourite to contest Holborn and St Pancras after Starmer’s resignation</p><p>Zack Polanski moved a step closer in his quest to become an MP on Wednesday, with local Green party members supporting him to become the party’s candidate in the Holborn and St Pancras byelection.</p><p>The party leader in England and Wales started campaigning alongside his fellow Green, Hannah Spencer, the MP for Gorton and Denton, in the Holborn area on Tuesday, and is seriously considering putting himself forward as the party’s candidate in the seat <a href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/politics/2026/sep/01/keir-starmer-to-stand-down-as-mp\">vacated by Keir Starmer on Monday</a>.</p> <a href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/politics/2026/sep/02/green-party-members-back-zack-polanski-to-stand-in-london-byelection\">Continue reading...</a>"
